   "id": "e8",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.48,
      445.32,
      289.08,
      453.96
     ],
     "text": "This variety was selected for its prostrate growth"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      455.04,
      298.8,
      464.04
     ],
     "text": "habit in 1980 from seedlings of Acacia cardiophylla"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      465.12,
      264.96,
      474.12
     ],
     "text": "sown and grown on the breeders property."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      88.2,
      474.84,
      288.72,
      483.84
     ],
     "text": "Material has been vegetatively propagated since"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      484.56,
      298.8,
      493.2
     ],
     "text": "selection and further evaluated by the applicant for"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      494.64,
      194.04,
      503.64
     ],
     "text": "its growth characteristics."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "This variety was selected for its prostrate growth\nhabit in 1980 from seedlings of Acacia cardiophylla\nsown and grown on the breeders property.\nMaterial has been vegetatively propagated since\nselection and further evaluated by the applicant for\nits growth characteristics.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    87.12,
    512.64,
    295.2,
    602.64
   ],
   "id": "e9",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      512.64,
      249.48,
      524.52
     ],
     "text": "Morphology \u2014 See comparison tables."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      523.8,
      282.24,
      532.8
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Kuranga Gold Lace\u2019 is a perennial shrub with a"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.12,
      533.88,
      294.12,
      542.88
     ],
     "text": "trailing prostrate growth habit. Its flowering is not"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.48,
      543.96,
      247.68,
      551.16
     ],
     "text": "observed to differ from the standard A."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.48,
      553.68,
      292.32,
      563.04
     ],
     "text": "cardiophylla form. Flowering occurs from August"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.48,
      564.12,
      277.56,
      573.12
     ],
     "text": "to September, when the plants produce many"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      573.84,
      281.88,
      582.84
     ],
     "text": "mildly perfumed golden yellow globular heads"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      583.56,
      295.2,
      592.2
     ],
     "text": "about 1 cm in diameter in dense ancillary racemes"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.48,
      594.0,
      139.68,
      602.64
     ],
     "text": "3-5 cm long."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "Morphology \u2014 See comparison tables.\n\u2018Kuranga Gold Lace\u2019 is a perennial shrub with a\ntrailing prostrate growth habit. Its flowering is not\nobserved to differ from the standard A.\ncardiophylla form. Flowering occurs from August\nto September, when the plants produce many\nmildly perfumed golden yellow globular heads\nabout 1 cm in diameter in dense ancillary racemes\n3-5 cm long.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    87.12,
    613.44,
    286.2,
    640.44
   ],
   "id": "e10",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.12,
      613.44,
      279.0,
      622.44
     ],
     "text": "The foliage of \u2018Kuranga Gold Lace\u2019 is typical A."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.48,
      623.16,
      286.2,
      632.16
     ],
     "text": "cardiophylia and not observed to differ from the"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.48,
      633.24,
      148.68,
      640.44
     ],
     "text": "standard form."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "The foliage of \u2018Kuranga Gold Lace\u2019 is typical A.\ncardiophylia and not observed to differ from the\nstandard form.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    87.12,
    652.68,
    297.36,
    701.28
   ],
   "id": "e11",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.12,
      652.68,
      275.76,
      661.32
     ],
     "text": "The stems\u2019 prostrate growth habit is the main"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.12,
      662.4,
      290.88,
      671.04
     ],
     "text": "characteristic distinguishing \u2018Kuranga Gold Lace\u2019"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.12,
      672.48,
      294.48,
      681.12
     ],
     "text": "from other A. cardiophylla. The stems of \u2018Kuranga"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.84,
      682.2,
      297.36,
      689.76
     ],
     "text": "Gold Lace\u2019 also differ from those of the standard A."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      87.12,
      692.28,
      270.72,
      701.28
     ],
     "text": "cardiophylia in becoming tortuous with age."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "The stems\u2019 prostrate growth habit is the main\ncharacteristic distinguishing \u2018Kuranga Gold Lace\u2019\nfrom other A. cardiophylla. The stems of \u2018Kuranga\nGold Lace\u2019 also differ from those of the standard A.\ncardiophylia in becoming tortuous with age.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
